1
00:01:34,473 --> 00:01:35,674
The sixth floor is Chinese.

2
00:01:35,874 --> 00:01:36,808
Oh.

3
00:01:37,108 --> 00:01:38,243
The fifth is Japanese.

4
00:01:38,477 --> 00:01:39,277
So good.

5
00:01:39,511 --> 00:01:40,812
The fourth, French cuisine.

6
00:01:41,012 --> 00:01:41,947
Wow!

7
00:01:42,347 --> 00:01:43,515
The third is Italian.

8
00:01:43,715 --> 00:01:44,683
Amazing!

9
00:01:45,083 --> 00:01:50,021
We buy all ingredients in bulk, so we can cook cheaply without waste.

10
00:01:50,956 --> 00:01:55,393
We're "Tabedaore", a nationwide general restaurant chain.

11
00:01:55,594 --> 00:01:58,430
We have everything. You'll never run out of menu options.

12
00:01:58,663 --> 00:02:00,899
Of course, we can also deliver everything.

13
00:02:01,233 --> 00:02:03,768
That's really appreciated. It's a big help.

14
00:02:04,035 --> 00:02:04,836
Right, Superintendent?

15
00:02:05,036 --> 00:02:07,839
Yeah, lunchtime's always been a hassle.

16
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:10,909
Even just our HQ alone will keep you busy.

17
00:02:11,243 --> 00:02:15,747
I hope so, but we're still new and short-staffed.

18
00:02:15,947 --> 00:02:18,383
Yeah, everyone's got staffing issues.

19
00:02:18,583 --> 00:02:21,419
Especially in delivery.

20
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:24,289
Ohara-kun, do you know anyone who might help?

21
00:02:24,523 --> 00:02:28,226
Leave it to me. I'll keep an eye out during patrols.

22
00:02:28,426 --> 00:02:29,728
Thank you very much.

23
00:02:29,928 --> 00:02:34,533
Oh, not at all. Serving the community is our duty.

24
00:02:34,733 --> 00:02:38,169
We're neighbors, right? We gotta help each other.

25
00:02:39,137 --> 00:02:43,742
Thanks to Tabedaore, we can use our time more efficiently.

26
00:02:45,010 --> 00:02:48,580
Hard, hard, ZX-Hard...

27
00:02:50,015 --> 00:02:51,116
I finally got it.

28
00:02:51,716 --> 00:02:52,984
Ohara-kun...

29
00:02:54,553 --> 00:02:56,821
What's that idiot doing?

30
00:02:57,155 --> 00:02:59,991
Whoa! That's the Cyber Trooper ZX-HARD!

31
00:03:00,191 --> 00:03:01,760
How did you get it?

32
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:04,496
I thought it was sold out everywhere!

33
00:03:04,729 --> 00:03:05,797
Wow!

34
00:03:06,431 --> 00:03:07,332
Amazing!

35
00:03:07,565 --> 00:03:11,803
Unbelievable! You left early this morning just to buy that.

36
00:03:12,103 --> 00:03:16,107
Heard someone spotted one at Toyu supermarket in Hachioji.

37
00:03:17,375 --> 00:03:19,511
I managed to get it.

38
00:03:20,111 --> 00:03:22,347
Ryotsu, what's that plastic model? A bonus item?

39
00:03:22,580 --> 00:03:25,016
That's the best part!

40
00:03:25,216 --> 00:03:28,753
It's got a built-in data chip. Plug it into the console,

41
00:03:28,954 --> 00:03:33,224
and you can control the robot just like the model.

42
00:03:33,858 --> 00:03:35,794
Ryo-san, let's battle!

43
00:03:35,994 --> 00:03:36,795
Let's do it!

44
00:03:37,195 --> 00:03:39,631
Okay, Gimme a sec. I'll build it right away.

45
00:03:41,533 --> 00:03:42,367
Wow!

46
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:43,368
So fast!

47
00:03:44,135 --> 00:03:46,037
This is nothing!

48
00:03:46,404 --> 00:03:47,405
R-Ryo...

49
00:03:47,672 --> 00:03:48,506
Okay, done!

50
00:03:50,075 --> 00:03:51,376
What the heck!

51
00:03:51,943 --> 00:03:52,777
Chief!

52
00:03:53,345 --> 00:03:56,214
Playing with toys on duty? Must be nice!

53
00:03:56,648 --> 00:03:57,983
Come on, Chief.

54
00:03:58,183 --> 00:04:02,721
I'm just bonding with the citizens...

55
00:04:03,355 --> 00:04:04,322
What?

56
00:04:04,689 --> 00:04:06,858
Do you think that excuse will work?

57
00:04:07,058 --> 00:04:08,526
Stop it, Chief!

58
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,362
Shut up! I'm confiscating this!

59
00:04:10,562 --> 00:04:12,564
Ryotsu's got stuff to do now.

60
00:04:12,831 --> 00:04:13,565
Aw, that sucks.

61
00:04:13,798 --> 00:04:14,532
Boring.

62
00:04:14,899 --> 00:04:18,803
Ryo-chan biked all the way to Hachioji just to buy that, you know.

63
00:04:19,104 --> 00:04:19,904
What?

64
00:04:20,105 --> 00:04:22,540
Reiko, how dare you tell on me!

65
00:04:23,008 --> 00:04:24,042
Cut it out, you fool!

66
00:04:26,745 --> 00:04:28,880
Hey, Ryo-san, I'm borrowing your ZX-Hard.

67
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:29,848
Borrowing.

68
00:04:30,048 --> 00:04:31,549
Wait, that's mine!

69
00:04:31,750 --> 00:04:35,053
If you really care about citizen bonding,

70
00:04:35,453 --> 00:04:38,189
help with delivery at the new restaurant next to HQ!

71
00:04:38,390 --> 00:04:43,261
Chief! That's got nothing to do with police work!

72
00:04:43,461 --> 00:04:46,865
Don't worry. I'll ask the superintendent to count it as paid leave.

73
00:04:47,065 --> 00:04:49,234
Did Ryotsu have any paid leave left?

74
00:04:49,434 --> 00:04:51,269
No way he does.

75
00:04:53,304 --> 00:04:54,739
"TABEDAORE"

76
00:04:55,106 --> 00:04:57,275
Ohara-san told me about you.

77
00:04:57,742 --> 00:04:59,911
The chief seriously strangled me.

78
00:05:00,445 --> 00:05:03,415
This is the delivery center where you'll be working.

79
00:05:06,851 --> 00:05:08,086
What's this?!

80
00:05:08,753 --> 00:05:11,222
Just like a communications command center!

81
00:05:26,104 --> 00:05:28,740
-Delivery ready for Kameari 4th district. -Roger that!

82
00:05:29,607 --> 00:05:31,643
Wow! No way this is a restaurant.

83
00:05:31,876 --> 00:05:34,245
Down here's the delivery waiting room.

84
00:05:34,579 --> 00:05:37,482
What? Looks like a narrow train car.

85
00:05:37,715 --> 00:05:40,251
You'll be in charge of the Katsushika Police HQ.

86
00:05:40,752 --> 00:05:42,454
What? I'll be delivering to HQ?

87
00:05:42,654 --> 00:05:44,322
You're the one who knows it best.

88
00:05:44,522 --> 00:05:46,458
That's true, but...

89
00:05:46,658 --> 00:05:48,526
Please wait on seat 13.

90
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:49,894
All right.

91
00:05:50,095 --> 00:05:51,329
Hey, nice to meet you.

92
00:05:51,529 --> 00:05:52,297
Sup.

93
00:05:53,331 --> 00:05:54,499
This one?

94
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,801
It's so cramped.

95
00:05:57,202 --> 00:06:00,271
Please take your delivery slip.

96
00:06:00,538 --> 00:06:01,339
This thing?

97
00:06:01,539 --> 00:06:04,375
Delivery number 13, standby for launch.

98
00:06:05,543 --> 00:06:06,478
What!

99
00:06:16,154 --> 00:06:19,357
Woah! This is like a secret base from a robot anime!

100
00:06:30,001 --> 00:06:32,537
"DELIVERY LAUNCH"

101
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:38,009
Delivery number 13, launch!

102
00:06:49,787 --> 00:06:51,189
Stop!

103
00:06:53,992 --> 00:06:55,160
Oh, Ryo-san!

104
00:06:55,660 --> 00:06:57,896
Outta the way! Tabedaore delivery coming through!

105
00:06:58,129 --> 00:06:59,864
"COMMUNITY DIVISION"

106
00:07:00,431 --> 00:07:02,367
Hello. Tabedaore's here.

107
00:07:03,234 --> 00:07:04,669
Uh, ramen is...

108
00:07:04,869 --> 00:07:06,905
Hey, ramen over here. Hurry up.

109
00:07:07,438 --> 00:07:09,574
Put it here, here. Don't spill the soup.

110
00:07:09,808 --> 00:07:11,609
Here you go, one ramen!

111
00:07:12,277 --> 00:07:13,278
Oh, Ryo-san!

112
00:07:15,079 --> 00:07:17,882
That's karma for talking down to me over just one bowl of ramen.

113
00:07:18,082 --> 00:07:19,450
Um, one green onion ramen...

114
00:07:19,684 --> 00:07:20,752
Yes, that's mine!

115
00:07:20,985 --> 00:07:22,220
I'll get it myself.

116
00:07:22,420 --> 00:07:23,388
Oh, all right.

117
00:07:24,155 --> 00:07:24,822
Me too!

118
00:07:25,023 --> 00:07:26,391
That's normal, right?

119
00:07:28,092 --> 00:07:29,194
This is easy.

120
00:07:29,394 --> 00:07:31,095
"TRAFFIC DIVISION"

121
00:07:31,396 --> 00:07:32,597
Right, right, right?

122
00:07:32,830 --> 00:07:34,832
Uh-huh, and then, and then...

123
00:07:35,033 --> 00:07:35,834
Hello.

124
00:07:36,034 --> 00:07:36,868
Oh, here they come.

125
00:07:37,068 --> 00:07:38,303
Ugh, Kankichi Ryotsu!

126
00:07:38,736 --> 00:07:40,471
What the heck are you doing here?

127
00:07:40,705 --> 00:07:43,274
Tch! It's you guys. Stop being lazy and go out to eat.

128
00:07:43,775 --> 00:07:44,742
None of your business!

129
00:07:44,943 --> 00:07:46,411
Hey, don't come in here

130
00:07:47,078 --> 00:07:49,414
What? Then come get it yourself!

131
00:07:49,614 --> 00:07:50,448
No way!

132
00:07:50,648 --> 00:07:52,417
Handle it yourself!

133
00:07:53,051 --> 00:07:54,853
Say what you want!

134
00:07:55,053 --> 00:07:58,022
Hmph, stupid women. Here, catch!

135
00:07:58,223 --> 00:07:59,123
He threw it!

136
00:07:59,324 --> 00:08:01,025
What are you doing, you savage?!

137
00:08:01,226 --> 00:08:02,493
Unbelievable!

138
00:08:02,727 --> 00:08:04,929
Shup up! Three more ramen!

139
00:08:06,598 --> 00:08:08,800
Next, fried rice! Yakisoba!

140
00:08:09,267 --> 00:08:10,768
How do you like that!

141
00:08:12,871 --> 00:08:14,105
Hi-yo, Silver!

142
00:08:14,305 --> 00:08:16,674
Hey! Kankichi Ryotsu!

143
00:08:16,975 --> 00:08:18,142
You'll pay for this!

144
00:08:18,343 --> 00:08:20,311
We're telling Chief Ohara!

145
00:08:22,213 --> 00:08:23,214
Hey, sorry.

146
00:08:23,615 --> 00:08:25,283
Katsudon for the interrogation room?

147
00:08:25,483 --> 00:08:26,618
Just like a cop drama.

148
00:08:26,818 --> 00:08:28,152
Be careful!

149
00:08:28,519 --> 00:08:30,521
Hello! Coming through.

150
00:08:30,755 --> 00:08:31,656
Hey, Ryo-san!

151
00:08:32,257 --> 00:08:33,791
Tell us your accomplice's name!

152
00:08:33,992 --> 00:08:34,926
I don't know!

153
00:08:35,126 --> 00:08:36,594
There must be someone. Fess up!

154
00:08:36,794 --> 00:08:38,429
I told you, I don't know!

155
00:08:38,830 --> 00:08:41,065
Hey, katsudon delivery here.

156
00:08:41,266 --> 00:08:42,300
Oh, thank you.

157
00:08:42,901 --> 00:08:46,337
Now eat this katsudon and you'll change your mind.

158
00:08:47,105 --> 00:08:49,374
Who'd eat this crap!

159
00:08:50,475 --> 00:08:51,843
Ah. Hey, you!

160
00:08:54,646 --> 00:08:56,714
How dare you insult my delivery?!

161
00:08:56,948 --> 00:08:58,349
What are you doing?

162
00:08:58,549 --> 00:08:59,384
Stop it, Ryo-san.

163
00:08:59,617 --> 00:09:00,285
It's bad.

164
00:09:00,485 --> 00:09:01,953
Shut up!

165
00:09:02,153 --> 00:09:03,121
Stay outta this!

166
00:09:03,321 --> 00:09:07,392
Let's see if it's really crap.

167
00:09:08,259 --> 00:09:09,394
Come on, eat it, try it!

168
00:09:09,627 --> 00:09:10,828
Hey, someone come here!

169
00:09:11,029 --> 00:09:12,864
Still got miso soup and pickles too.

170
00:09:13,097 --> 00:09:14,632
Hey, you're going too far, Ryo-san.

171
00:09:15,166 --> 00:09:17,702
You can't taste it unless you chew properly!

172
00:09:17,936 --> 00:09:19,704
H-Help me, Officer!

173
00:09:19,937 --> 00:09:21,673
Cut it out already, Ryo-san.

174
00:09:21,873 --> 00:09:23,207
Still more in the bowl!

175
00:09:23,841 --> 00:09:25,410
I'll tell you everything.

176
00:09:25,643 --> 00:09:27,412
Do something about him...

177
00:09:27,645 --> 00:09:29,180
Pay for the broken bowl!

178
00:09:29,380 --> 00:09:31,416
Okay, okay, Ryo-san...

179
00:09:32,717 --> 00:09:34,552
Try being on the delivery side for once.

180
00:09:34,752 --> 00:09:36,020
"SUPERINTENDENT'S OFFICE"

181
00:09:36,220 --> 00:09:38,556
Hey there, Tabedaore delivery here.

182
00:09:39,657 --> 00:09:41,559
Huh? No one's here.

183
00:09:42,593 --> 00:09:46,331
Order says five premium one-bite cutlet rice.

184
00:09:46,531 --> 00:09:47,565
Expecting guests?

185
00:09:48,499 --> 00:09:50,301
Anyway, I'm starving.

186
00:09:50,501 --> 00:09:52,370
Working hard with no lunch...

187
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:57,075
I deserve this.

188
00:09:57,308 --> 00:09:59,577
Delicious! Premium, no doubt!

189
00:10:00,178 --> 00:10:02,180
One more won't hurt, right?

190
00:10:03,848 --> 00:10:05,083
Might as well, a bit more.

191
00:10:05,983 --> 00:10:07,385
Oh, I'm stuffed.

192
00:10:08,753 --> 00:10:10,855
Now it really is one-bite cutlet rice.

193
00:10:11,923 --> 00:10:15,860
Gotta shrink the soup and cabbage too.

194
00:10:21,599 --> 00:10:22,800
Rice, too.

195
00:10:26,104 --> 00:10:28,206
This is the true one-bite cutlet rice.

196
00:10:28,406 --> 00:10:29,874
Ultimate diet food.

197
00:10:30,742 --> 00:10:33,244
Just right for the superintendent's belly.

198
00:10:33,444 --> 00:10:36,714
What a thoughtful employee I am.

199
00:10:36,914 --> 00:10:38,449
Oops, forgot this.

200
00:10:41,586 --> 00:10:42,286
Uh-oh!

201
00:10:42,487 --> 00:10:44,789
Oh no! This is the superintendent's favorite dish...

202
00:10:45,923 --> 00:10:48,459
Guess I'll swap it with a yakisoba plate.

203
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:51,129
He won't notice for a while.

204
00:10:51,662 --> 00:10:54,298
Hmm? These are... my written apologies.

205
00:10:54,899 --> 00:10:56,801
So this is where he hid them.

206
00:10:57,035 --> 00:10:59,070
I'll dispose of them in secret.

207
00:10:59,504 --> 00:11:02,940
Might be other stuff he confiscated from me.

208
00:11:03,908 --> 00:11:05,376
Well, next to HQ...

209
00:11:05,576 --> 00:11:07,044
Oh no, they're back.

210
00:11:08,045 --> 00:11:08,746
Me too...

211
00:11:08,946 --> 00:11:10,148
Can't go into the hallway.

212
00:11:11,315 --> 00:11:12,650
I'll hide here for now.

213
00:11:12,850 --> 00:11:16,387
That guy's the worst officer we've got.

214
00:11:16,587 --> 00:11:19,991
Honestly, I wish he'd just stay a delivery boy.

215
00:11:20,224 --> 00:11:22,493
Damn, they're just saying whatever they want.

216
00:11:22,693 --> 00:11:23,528
The food's here.

217
00:11:23,761 --> 00:11:24,996
What's this tiny portion?!

218
00:11:25,229 --> 00:11:26,998
It must be Ryotsu's doing.

219
00:11:27,231 --> 00:11:30,268
No one else would pull this kind of childish prank.

220
00:11:31,169 --> 00:11:32,970
The Arita-ware dish has been swapped!

221
00:11:33,171 --> 00:11:35,006
It's a cheap delivery plate.

222
00:11:35,239 --> 00:11:35,973
What!

223
00:11:36,474 --> 00:11:39,177
That was a gift from the regional director...

224
00:11:40,311 --> 00:11:42,680
Ahh! The written apologies I stored here are gone!

225
00:11:44,882 --> 00:11:46,684
Who is it? Ryotsu?

226
00:11:46,884 --> 00:11:48,820
Ugh, I'm done for!

227
00:11:53,691 --> 00:11:54,525
Ohara-kun!

228
00:11:54,725 --> 00:11:55,860
Are you okay, Ohara-kun?

229
00:11:58,162 --> 00:12:00,465
He's over there. What a fast escape...

230
00:12:00,665 --> 00:12:02,166
Damn you, Ryotsu!

231
00:12:19,584 --> 00:12:22,353
In the end, this is the best place.

232
00:12:22,553 --> 00:12:25,056
Are you okay slacking off here, Ryo-chan?

233
00:12:25,690 --> 00:12:29,227
Working for free is so stupid. I can't stand it.

234
00:12:29,894 --> 00:12:31,662
Here, I made you some barley tea.

235
00:12:31,863 --> 00:12:34,765
Thanks. Sorry to trouble you.

236
00:12:34,999 --> 00:12:37,602
-Nothing beats a cold drink after work. -Oh, it's hot, hot.

237
00:12:37,835 --> 00:12:40,238
Thanks for the patrol, Kei-chan. Here you go.

238
00:12:40,471 --> 00:12:41,572
Oh, thank you.

239
00:12:45,042 --> 00:12:48,746
Huh, Ryotsu? Are you okay hanging out here?

240
00:12:49,714 --> 00:12:52,383
Nakagawa!

241
00:12:53,784 --> 00:12:54,485
Not mine.

242
00:12:55,319 --> 00:12:56,621
Not mine either.

243
00:12:56,854 --> 00:12:58,022
It's mine.

244
00:12:58,222 --> 00:13:00,491
Dish collecting is my job too, huh?

245
00:13:02,727 --> 00:13:04,262
Another delivery, Ryo-san?

246
00:13:04,495 --> 00:13:05,897
Must be nice to be busy.

247
00:13:06,097 --> 00:13:06,964
Shut up!

248
00:13:08,199 --> 00:13:09,567
What the heck are these?

249
00:13:09,934 --> 00:13:11,769
Leaving this much food behind...

250
00:13:11,969 --> 00:13:14,639
Try being the one who has to collect them.

251
00:13:15,973 --> 00:13:19,577
I'm only here to collect the dishes.

252
00:13:25,516 --> 00:13:28,553
You must clean up after yourself.

253
00:13:28,953 --> 00:13:32,523
Modern people need to learn how valuable food is.

254
00:13:32,790 --> 00:13:35,293
And that guy is Cho Yong-pil.

255
00:13:38,996 --> 00:13:41,132
"THANKS. ENJOY THIS DURING YOUR BREAK."

256
00:13:41,365 --> 00:13:44,302
Oh, there are still kind-hearted people.

257
00:13:44,535 --> 00:13:49,473
Thoughtful gestures like this really keep us going...

258
00:13:51,309 --> 00:13:56,113
Who the hell did this?

259
00:13:57,982 --> 00:14:01,586
Using a sacred bowl as an ashtray.

260
00:14:03,754 --> 00:14:04,555
Was it you?

261
00:14:04,755 --> 00:14:06,657
N-No, Ryo-san...

262
00:14:06,857 --> 00:14:07,592
Not me!

263
00:14:07,792 --> 00:14:08,659
No, not me either.

264
00:14:10,261 --> 00:14:11,262
Hey, who did it?

265
00:14:11,462 --> 00:14:14,165
Not me! It was him!

266
00:14:14,599 --> 00:14:16,100
Hey, you!

267
00:14:16,300 --> 00:14:19,837
I-I'm sorry, really sorry! I did it on a sudden impulse.

268
00:14:20,171 --> 00:14:23,674
Even if the heavens forgive your sins,

269
00:14:23,874 --> 00:14:25,710
I will not!

270
00:14:27,144 --> 00:14:29,046
I'm sorry!

271
00:14:31,182 --> 00:14:32,850
Make sure it doesn't happen again.

272
00:14:33,784 --> 00:14:35,052
Y-Yes sir...

273
00:14:38,889 --> 00:14:41,192
Man, I can't take it anymore.

274
00:14:41,425 --> 00:14:44,261
Getting launched from that catapult all day,

275
00:14:44,695 --> 00:14:46,964
I'm gonna break at this rate.

276
00:14:48,966 --> 00:14:49,600
Hello.

277
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:52,737
Ryotsu-san, what the heck did you do?

278
00:14:53,371 --> 00:14:55,740
We've had nonstop complaints.

279
00:14:56,340 --> 00:14:59,377
Don't worry. I'm doing my job right.

280
00:14:59,610 --> 00:15:00,511
Don't lie!

281
00:15:01,178 --> 00:15:01,912
Oh, Chief!

282
00:15:02,146 --> 00:15:04,515
I've heard everything!

283
00:15:05,549 --> 00:15:08,853
You went wild not only in the office but all over the place!

284
00:15:09,353 --> 00:15:13,357
Well, their attitude was so bad that I just...

285
00:15:13,824 --> 00:15:15,059
You idiot!

286
00:15:15,860 --> 00:15:18,295
You, the laziest man in Japan,

287
00:15:18,496 --> 00:15:20,731
have no right to talk about other people's manners!

288
00:15:20,931 --> 00:15:22,566
You don't know your place!

289
00:15:23,067 --> 00:15:27,705
Anyway, you'll be paying back the damage out of your paycheck!

290
00:15:27,905 --> 00:15:31,175
Oh no! First unpaid labor, and now wage cuts?

291
00:15:31,375 --> 00:15:34,078
I don't know what I'm working for!

292
00:15:34,679 --> 00:15:37,348
Then try working honestly!

293
00:15:37,548 --> 00:15:38,416
Apologize, Ryotsu!

294
00:15:38,716 --> 00:15:40,518
Ouch, that hurts, Chief!

295
00:15:40,718 --> 00:15:43,688
Now, now, Ohara-san. You don't have to go that far.

296
00:15:43,888 --> 00:15:46,924
No, please contact me if he causes any more trouble.

297
00:15:47,391 --> 00:15:49,393
O-Okay.

298
00:15:49,593 --> 00:15:51,562
Since you introduced him,

299
00:15:51,762 --> 00:15:53,664
and we'd appreciate any help we can get now.

300
00:15:54,231 --> 00:15:55,933
Thank you.

301
00:16:00,338 --> 00:16:01,605
Waiter, one more!

302
00:16:02,139 --> 00:16:03,774
Give me another one.

303
00:16:03,974 --> 00:16:05,743
Pachusanha, coming up!

304
00:16:08,379 --> 00:16:10,114
Kaulong Taishi, ready to go!

305
00:16:11,248 --> 00:16:12,983
Hurry up!

306
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:19,090
Working this hard for free? The chief's gonna pay for this.

307
00:16:19,290 --> 00:16:20,991
Six fried rice coming up!

308
00:16:21,225 --> 00:16:24,595
So, why do I have to join you?

309
00:16:24,795 --> 00:16:26,564
Come on, don't be so uptight.

310
00:16:26,764 --> 00:16:31,068
Let's share the joy of labor together!

311
00:16:31,268 --> 00:16:32,903
It's fine, while you're young...

312
00:16:33,104 --> 00:16:37,074
I had a bad feeling since Ryotsu called me in.

313
00:16:41,078 --> 00:16:42,580
This place is pretty good.

314
00:16:43,314 --> 00:16:45,316
Oh, customers. Honda, go!

315
00:16:45,916 --> 00:16:49,553
Manager, please come to the guest room.

316
00:16:49,754 --> 00:16:52,156
Chief Ohara from Katsushika PD is here.

317
00:16:52,757 --> 00:16:53,824
What?!

318
00:16:54,558 --> 00:16:57,995
A welcome reception for an overseas guest here?

319
00:16:58,562 --> 00:17:01,799
Yes, he's suddenly coming for an inspection tomorrow.

320
00:17:01,999 --> 00:17:04,568
I know this is a lot to ask,

321
00:17:05,269 --> 00:17:07,605
but I'd really like to use this place.

322
00:17:07,805 --> 00:17:08,639
I see.

323
00:17:09,673 --> 00:17:11,208
It's not about me.

324
00:17:11,642 --> 00:17:15,513
If it's Ohara-san asking, I'll make it work.

325
00:17:15,746 --> 00:17:16,614
Then...

326
00:17:17,148 --> 00:17:18,983
Yes, leave it to me.

327
00:17:19,183 --> 00:17:20,351
Thank you very much.

328
00:17:23,587 --> 00:17:26,157
This is my chance for revenge!

329
00:17:27,792 --> 00:17:30,494
What?! All the cooks are off?

330
00:17:30,694 --> 00:17:35,533
Yes, we just got a call that they suddenly got sick and had to take a day off.

331
00:17:35,766 --> 00:17:40,337
Oh my God! The Katsushika PD's reception is today.

332
00:17:41,205 --> 00:17:46,143
Unsafe construction was found. We'll be closed tomorrow.

333
00:17:47,178 --> 00:17:48,646
No need to worry.

334
00:17:48,846 --> 00:17:50,881
In fact, one of my very close friends

335
00:17:51,081 --> 00:17:55,986
used to be the head chef of some famous hotel.

336
00:17:56,187 --> 00:17:57,254
Really?

337
00:17:57,488 --> 00:18:01,358
He once beat all the Iron Chefs in a cooking battle.

338
00:18:01,559 --> 00:18:02,460
No way!

339
00:18:02,660 --> 00:18:04,995
For some reason, he's put down his knife now,

340
00:18:05,196 --> 00:18:07,898
but I'm sure he'll come running if I ask him.

341
00:18:09,166 --> 00:18:12,203
Please call him at once.

342
00:18:12,403 --> 00:18:14,905
Okay. Leave it to me.

343
00:18:15,105 --> 00:18:19,410
However, this person hates being seen cooking.

344
00:18:20,110 --> 00:18:21,011
What?

345
00:18:21,212 --> 00:18:24,582
Even if you are the manager, please don't look into the kitchen.

346
00:18:24,815 --> 00:18:28,385
U-Understood. I swear I won't look.

347
00:18:28,819 --> 00:18:31,856
He's so late... that chef of your friend.

348
00:18:32,056 --> 00:18:33,657
There's no such guy.

349
00:18:34,124 --> 00:18:37,061
What?! Then who's cooking today?

350
00:18:38,429 --> 00:18:39,430
I am!

351
00:18:40,965 --> 00:18:43,934
To show my appreciation, I'll make a Ryotsu-style special menu,

352
00:18:44,134 --> 00:18:47,438
for the chief and other guys to fully enjoy.

353
00:18:48,672 --> 00:18:49,507
All right, then...

354
00:18:50,975 --> 00:18:52,610
Soup is the basis of any dish.

355
00:18:53,277 --> 00:18:56,680
First, let's get plenty of broth from my body.

356
00:18:56,881 --> 00:18:57,615
Ewww...

357
00:18:58,115 --> 00:19:01,385
It was a very meaningful day

358
00:19:01,585 --> 00:19:03,954
to visit the Japanese police.

359
00:19:04,255 --> 00:19:06,690
I'd like to express my gratitude.

360
00:19:06,891 --> 00:19:08,959
Thank you very much, Superintendent.

361
00:19:09,727 --> 00:19:11,595
W-What did he say?

362
00:19:11,795 --> 00:19:13,764
He said it was very meaningful, thank you.

363
00:19:14,331 --> 00:19:16,967
Oh, thank you. Thank you, please.

364
00:19:17,167 --> 00:19:19,069
Friend. Tempura.

365
00:19:24,475 --> 00:19:26,443
Superintendent, let's start the meal.

366
00:19:26,644 --> 00:19:27,645
Oh, that's right.

367
00:19:36,553 --> 00:19:37,821
You seem to be working hard.

368
00:19:38,022 --> 00:19:38,989
Of course.

369
00:19:41,125 --> 00:19:42,426
W-What's this, Ryotsu?

370
00:19:42,793 --> 00:19:44,762
This is our special menu.

371
00:19:44,962 --> 00:19:47,431
This restaurant has top chefs.

372
00:19:47,831 --> 00:19:50,601
Please try this rare delicacy.

373
00:19:51,001 --> 00:19:53,003
Have it while it's still hot.

374
00:19:53,270 --> 00:19:54,838
Let's eat then.

375
00:19:55,039 --> 00:19:55,839
Yes.

376
00:19:59,643 --> 00:20:01,278
What's this soup?

377
00:20:01,679 --> 00:20:03,681
Ryo-chan, what kind of soup is this?

378
00:20:03,914 --> 00:20:07,051
The chief said that he's confident in this unique, flavorful soup,

379
00:20:07,284 --> 00:20:09,820
made from the currently very popular green juice,

380
00:20:10,020 --> 00:20:12,690
using French cooking techniques.

381
00:20:21,865 --> 00:20:23,334
The next dish.

382
00:20:23,534 --> 00:20:25,936
Oh, I love sushi!

383
00:20:29,673 --> 00:20:31,809
What? It's got chocolate in it.

384
00:20:32,009 --> 00:20:36,547
It's a dish that combines traditional Japanese sushi and Western sweets.

385
00:20:36,780 --> 00:20:38,382
The tea is actually hot cocoa.

386
00:20:40,517 --> 00:20:42,886
Please enjoy the Japanese-Westen fusion flavors.

387
00:20:44,321 --> 00:20:45,189
They're eating...

388
00:20:45,389 --> 00:20:47,191
How can everyone eat them?

389
00:20:47,658 --> 00:20:50,961
They think it's made by a first-class chef.

390
00:20:51,161 --> 00:20:53,497
The human tongue is quite unreliable.

391
00:20:53,697 --> 00:20:56,166
All right, let's prepare the next dish.

392
00:20:58,002 --> 00:20:59,436
Oh, tempura!

393
00:21:00,571 --> 00:21:03,440
Tempura with jelly, gummy candy, and nata de coco.

394
00:21:03,674 --> 00:21:05,976
Enjoy the unique texture.

395
00:21:06,677 --> 00:21:09,680
Please enjoy, Superintendent, Chief.

396
00:21:10,247 --> 00:21:11,548
It's really something...

397
00:21:12,082 --> 00:21:13,450
This is a spicy steak.

398
00:21:13,884 --> 00:21:17,721
It's more than just spicy, it's super spicy, as you can see.

399
00:21:20,991 --> 00:21:23,060
A-Are you okay, Ohara-kun?

400
00:21:23,560 --> 00:21:25,195
Excuse me for a moment.

401
00:21:33,003 --> 00:21:33,837
Ohara-san.

402
00:21:34,538 --> 00:21:36,607
How is it? Enjoying the food?

403
00:21:37,775 --> 00:21:40,110
They're quite creative dishes.

404
00:21:41,078 --> 00:21:42,379
I'm simply amazed.

405
00:21:42,579 --> 00:21:44,415
I'm glad you enjoyed them.

406
00:21:45,015 --> 00:21:48,552
After all, they were made by Ryotsu-san's chef friend,

407
00:21:48,752 --> 00:21:50,888
so I haven't tried them myself.

408
00:21:51,088 --> 00:21:52,156
W-What?!

409
00:21:53,323 --> 00:21:57,628
Actually, all of our cooks are on sudden sick leave.

410
00:21:59,430 --> 00:22:00,731
Um, is something wrong?

411
00:22:01,331 --> 00:22:04,034
Damn Ryotsu!

412
00:22:05,035 --> 00:22:06,804
Dessert is a cake with fireworks.

413
00:22:07,037 --> 00:22:08,872
It's gonna explode in their mouths!

414
00:22:09,073 --> 00:22:09,773
Just kidding.

415
00:22:09,973 --> 00:22:12,142
And then, spread lots of cream all around.

416
00:22:12,342 --> 00:22:14,311
I made this cake myself...

417
00:22:14,745 --> 00:22:16,814
Igniting a smokeless fuse...

418
00:22:17,714 --> 00:22:20,718
Can't wait to see what happens.

419
00:22:20,918 --> 00:22:22,086
Really?

420
00:22:23,153 --> 00:22:25,489
Ryotsu!

421
00:22:25,889 --> 00:22:27,124
Ch-Chief!

422
00:22:27,324 --> 00:22:28,592
I knew it was you!

423
00:22:28,792 --> 00:22:31,729
Chief, my neck, neck...

424
00:22:32,262 --> 00:22:35,466
What about your neck? This time, you're gonna pay!

425
00:22:35,666 --> 00:22:39,436
I'll serve you up as sashimi and apologize to everyone!

426
00:22:39,803 --> 00:22:41,371
O-O-Oh no, oh no...

427
00:22:42,439 --> 00:22:43,273
What?

428
00:22:46,810 --> 00:22:48,512
Were you planning something like this?

429
00:22:48,746 --> 00:22:51,215
Chief, it's just some entertainment.

430
00:22:55,219 --> 00:22:57,755
Aah! F-Fire!

431
00:22:57,955 --> 00:22:59,857
Don't panic! Fire extinguisher!

432
00:23:00,090 --> 00:23:00,958
Y-Yes!

433
00:23:03,026 --> 00:23:04,661
Ryotsu, Shut off the gas valve first!

434
00:23:04,862 --> 00:23:05,529
Yes!

435
00:23:14,171 --> 00:23:18,041
Chief, look. It came off.

436
00:23:30,654 --> 00:23:32,055
Phew, I thought I was gonna die.

437
00:23:32,256 --> 00:23:33,123
Ryotsu!

438
00:23:33,323 --> 00:23:34,424
Are you okay, Chief?

439
00:23:34,658 --> 00:23:35,826
Damn you!

440
00:23:36,360 --> 00:23:39,496
Please stop, Chief! Everyone makes mistakes.

441
00:23:39,696 --> 00:23:42,199
-Your existence itself is a mistake! -Stop it!

442
00:23:42,399 --> 00:23:45,068
-I knew it would come to this. -Yeah.

443
00:23:45,269 --> 00:23:48,739
Superintendent Tonda, thank you for introducing him, but...

444
00:23:48,972 --> 00:23:50,607
No need to say it all.

445
00:23:50,841 --> 00:23:53,076
I know very well what you're going to say.

446
00:23:53,977 --> 00:23:55,712
Ryotsu!

447
00:23:55,913 --> 00:23:58,382
Chief, please stop. I didn't mean it.

448
00:23:58,582 --> 00:24:00,751
-Help me, Honda. Ouch! -Take this, this, this...
